{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:21:203","content":{"id":203,"title":"19 抗原层递","content":[{"children":[{"text":"辅助 T 洗吧只会碰那些抱在细胞表面 MHC-II 类分子中的抗原，这样就不会碰到血液或淋巴液中的游离抗原。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"5de91ae4-dba9-4cf2-946e-0d795edee444","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"过程：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"113c1cba-e3c8-40e6-aa6a-70cba6fb397f","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"树突细胞在战场把细菌的抗原包裹在 MHC-II 类分子中","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"3fe986c7-e339-404d-b32d-2e2a85efb828","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"cc053225-5649-4439-bdec-d48d2165923d","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"树突细胞开始迁移，经淋巴系统来到淋巴结，找到辅助 T 细胞","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"ad09be55-1d36-4881-8132-e679b97cb6da","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"f4985142-74a8-4ef0-9996-06a7c91ce59a","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"辅助 T 细胞如果能识别抗原，就会和抗原结合","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"461473f5-ef27-4116-ac38-65e08c29fbc6","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"5eba2d35-f47c-4748-b01e-aff77aebd7bc","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"为防止辅助 T 细胞意外激活，还需要另一种信号","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"3aa53a58-873b-47f0-98c1-b944d77e6a14","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"db439c98-555e-46df-bbbf-1c44d7845804","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"1d3a2504-74d6-4aa7-87b7-037d05d87cd7","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","type":"numbered-list"},{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"facea0f8-1dfb-46a3-8a92-ec591396b64d","pasteUploading":false,"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_6a7d6fe4-44fe-4094-8995-5cc06a8abd4f.png","tauContract":"9d766f08643a09b151c9500b642decb7d9f8625878621cbd90af820668058ac0","type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_6a7d6fe4-44fe-4094-8995-5cc06a8abd4f.png"},{"children":[{"text":"到达淋巴结后，树突细胞有一周左右时间需找到合适的 T 细胞，之后内部凋亡程序启动，随机自杀。定时删除可确保不会按照过时的信息行动。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"a20f80ae-9bd7-48df-b160-bcc4c5badb64","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"《战斗细胞》","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:170","type":"doc","id":170}},{"label":"第二部分，惨重损伤"},{"label":"19 抗原层递","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:203","type":"doc","id":203}}],"prevPage":{"title":"18 胸腺 -- 杀手大师","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:175","type":"doc","id":175}},"nextPage":{"title":"20 唤醒适应性免疫系统：T细胞","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:204","type":"doc","id":204}},"createTime":1741563743837,"updateTime":1793532538394,"projectId":21},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1793532538394}}